{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35609","headline":"上元怀古二首 二 · 李山甫","name":"上元怀古二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"争帝图王德尽衰，骤兴驰霸亦何爲。\n君臣都是一塲笑，家国共成千载悲。\n排岸远樯森似槊，落波残照赫如旗。\n今朝城上难回首，不见楼船索战时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}